-**Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-- **Refinement Noise Injection:** When refining, simply starting the loop at a later timestep is insufficient if the scheduler expects a specific noise level [G]. The `strength` parameter determines `init_step`, effectively skipping early denoising steps to preserve the input structure [S1, unofficial].
-- **Boundary Conditions:** The spatial dimensions of latents are derived from `height // 8` and `width // 8`, assuming an 8x downsampling factor typical of VAEs [G].
